Tiers and activation
--------------------

Some capabilities require a paid activation, which is checked against an
Ed25519-signed envelope cached locally so the relay keeps working
offline. Which capabilities those are is stated in the documentation for
each release. Transport encryption for the web interface will never be
behind a paid tier.


